{"unit_id":"MrMu666__dsh-lan-tool#card-zh","repo":"MrMu666/dsh-lan-tool","commit":"b5ef2e47430488f351ac6e0a5a27c8b1977b2db8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-tool 是面向 DSH Web GUI 的插件，为局域网设备提供口令保护的远程访问，并在手机竖屏时调整桌面界面的触控布局。插件作为 DSH bundle 注入 Web 界面和连接服务；开启设置页的局域网访问后，由插件自己的代理监听本机 LAN 地址并转发到 DSH 的 loopback 服务，关闭后停止代理。它提供口令设置与解锁、访问状态和防火墙状态显示、浏览器记住口令，以及手机端布局和输入交互适配。适合希望从同一局域网的手机或其他浏览器继续使用 DSH 会话的人。需要 DSH 0.2.1-rc.5；不需要额外 API Key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1833","lib/index.js:2251","lib/lan-proxy.js:1","lib/client.js:21"]}
{"unit_id":"MrMu666__dsh-lan-tool#card-en","repo":"MrMu666/dsh-lan-tool","commit":"b5ef2e47430488f351ac6e0a5a27c8b1977b2db8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-lan-tool adds password-gated LAN access to the DSH Web GUI. Its proxy forwards requests to DSH on loopback, and a Settings card controls access and password status. It also adapts the desktop interface for portrait phones. Requires DSH 0.2.1-rc.5; no API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1833","lib/index.js:2251","lib/lan-proxy.js:1","lib/client.js:21"]}
