{"unit_id":"MrMu666__dsh-lan-tool#feature-1","repo":"MrMu666/dsh-lan-tool","commit":"b5ef2e47430488f351ac6e0a5a27c8b1977b2db8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-tool 的功能「局域网反向代理」：启用开关后，插件在本机 LAN 地址接收请求并转发到 loopback 上的 DSH 服务，复用 DSH 端口。。在 DSH 设置开关或访问页面时触发，提供局域网 GUI 访问及相应状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1833"]}
{"unit_id":"MrMu666__dsh-lan-tool#feature-2","repo":"MrMu666/dsh-lan-tool","commit":"b5ef2e47430488f351ac6e0a5a27c8b1977b2db8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-tool 的功能「口令访问」：远程设备通过口令解锁后访问页面和代理 API；本机请求由服务端按连接来源识别。。在 DSH 设置开关或访问页面时触发，提供局域网 GUI 访问及相应状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1484"]}
{"unit_id":"MrMu666__dsh-lan-tool#feature-3","repo":"MrMu666/dsh-lan-tool","commit":"b5ef2e47430488f351ac6e0a5a27c8b1977b2db8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-tool 的功能「设置卡片」：在 DSH 设置中显示 LAN 开关、口令配置及绑定和防火墙状态。。在 DSH 设置开关或访问页面时触发，提供局域网 GUI 访问及相应状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1246"]}
{"unit_id":"MrMu666__dsh-lan-tool#feature-4","repo":"MrMu666/dsh-lan-tool","commit":"b5ef2e47430488f351ac6e0a5a27c8b1977b2db8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-tool 的功能「竖屏触控适配」：检测竖屏、粗指针及窄视口后调整布局、触控尺寸和输入交互。。在 DSH 设置开关或访问页面时触发，提供局域网 GUI 访问及相应状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:21"]}
