{"unit_id":"MrMu666__dsh-lan-tool#caveat-1","repo":"MrMu666/dsh-lan-tool","commit":"b5ef2e47430488f351ac6e0a5a27c8b1977b2db8","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-tool 使用前须知：局域网访问依赖用户设置的口令；代理会把访问转发到本机 DSH 服务，开启访问前应理解口令可访问 DSH 数据。（见 lib/index.js:1489）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1489"]}
